{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-22T15:59:26.973Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"60205bbb5b285c4b3060e68d","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Original unguarded SDK reproduction loses the newer value. Package mitigation now refuses an over-budget callback before returning: real SDK and separate CLI takeover cases pass 2/2; reverting only guardEditMutation fails 0/2 and overwrites newer values. Integration guards also pass. This is not an atomic persistence fence: SDK delays before callback entry or after return remain upstream in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1549, verified by the owner on 2026.10.22. No upstream edit or dependency bump."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-22T15:59:26.973Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/description","value":"PR 179 thread PRRT_kwDOSYpI8s6vNO6H identifies missing atomic lease/revision fencing in the host SDK. The original real non-git reproduction demonstrates lost updates on lease takeover. The owner authorized a pm-csv callback deadline mitigation: refuse elapsed callbacks at effective TTL minus margin, preserving newer SDK/CLI writes in passing regressions. The root atomic persistence fix belongs upstream in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1549. This follow-up remains open for upstream verification; callback deadlines alone cannot protect arbitrary SDK delays outside the callback."}],"before_hash":"0b82b5d17177594d3cbfb7313b8fd831108d7b3619b78bfb4a3ec128b7077aef","after_hash":"5a576a2b637b2ada717b11e722e182b90d66ddb56fc077f69b17aba543f26288","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","reso